{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生 山田桃実(やまだももみ)です☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single BACKS曲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「コインランドリー」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/ae6N-FcsJmQ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Music Videoが公開されました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "観ていただけたでしょうか~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とにかく全てが好きです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特に皆さんの笑顔がすき"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobgXMwWu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob7Qrck3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobJBCGul.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メリーゴーランドにうきうきしてたら、スタッフさんが乗っていいよと言ってくださったので喜んで乗りました🎠"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乗ったことはありますが、記憶の彼方でたぶん小学生の時とか、？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "他にもコーヒーカップとかよく公園に置いてある動物の遊具とかあって、セットを見るだけでも楽しかったなあ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobUq8tpT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "影の時の衣装~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回、初めて影になってダンスをしました\nちょっぴり苦戦したけど新鮮で楽しかったです~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobxTc2am.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆーづさん~\n優しくて可愛くてかっこいいお姉さんです\n今シングル一緒に活動できるのが楽しみです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobSCUBuh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "休憩中のピース\nわこのピースは大人しめ\nわたしは元気め"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobUfGusX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また大好きな作品が1つ増えました。\nこの楽曲とMVに出会えて幸せです~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひたくさん観て、聴いてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🎤四期生LIVEまであと7日です~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "公式Xにて、毎日四期生カウントダウンしています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はひなが担当しています~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと1週間\nいい意味で、どんな景色が待っているのか全く想像つきません"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わくわくだなー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "絶対みてほしいな、！\nみて後悔はさせないよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobvZ1Lp6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "！！！！！！！！！\n頑張れます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後までブログを読んでくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またきてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "山田桃実"}], "source": "official"}